WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:02.420
It's hard to struggle alone.

2
00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.250
If you're gonna struggle, at least
you'll struggle with someone else.

3
00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.440
And then you help each other
out along the way.

4
00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:10.090
I happened to meet Dr. Hamamoto,

5
00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.830
the previous practice owner,
at a study group.

6
00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:15.230
She offered to sell the practice
because of the good fit,

7
00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:18.700
personality-wise,
and dental philosophy-wise as well.

8
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:22.320
She tells me that my demeanor
is similar to her predecessor,

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.820
Dr. Benson Kanemoto before her,
who she took over the practice from.

10
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.420
So this practice does have
a lot of history,

11
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.640
and a lot of patients are still around.

12
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.730
And it's almost kind of full circle.

13
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.330
She's like an auntie to me now,
and like her nephew.

14
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:39.430
That can be scary for patients
when someone else new comes in.

15
00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:41.530
But getting Kris's blessing,

16
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.700
and then having them
just get a chance to meet me,

17
00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.990
it kind of helps with that
fear of the unknown.

18
00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.160
Just keep on building,
keep on growing.

19
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.187
[Music]
